        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> cfallin submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15143#pullrequestreview-5772356724\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks -- some comments below.</p>\n</blockquote>",
