    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15143#discussion_r4470586358\">PR review comment</a>.</p>",
