    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"repeat\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f501\" role=\"img\" title=\"repeat\">:repeat:</span> pchickey submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15143#pullrequestreview-5773555192\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Along the lines of Chris's review - redefining the impl for Duration to be always nonzero is the wrong choice, especially with the semantically meaningful rename on import, which we definitely don't want to do.</p>\n<p>Lets instead make a newtype wrapper NonzeroDuration(Duration) and a WasmtimeOptionValue impl for that, based on the Duration impl, that excludes zero. NonzeroDuration can impl Deref&lt;Target=Duration&gt; for usability.</p>\n</blockquote>",
